@page "/"

<PageTitle>Holonet Agents</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="hero-eyebrow">Multi-agent orchestration</p>
        <h1>Holonet Agents</h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">
            A chat workspace for the agents in your Microsoft Foundry project. Ask a question in plain
            language and a team of specialized agents classifies it, researches it, and returns a single
            synthesized answer.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="chat">Open Holonet Chat</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" href="#specialists">Browse specialists</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <svg class="hero-art" viewBox="0 0 460 320" role="img" aria-labelledby="hero-art-title hero-art-desc">
        <title id="hero-art-title">The Holonet agent workflow</title>
        <desc id="hero-art-desc">
            A request flows into the orchestrator, fans out to the character, vehicle, planet, event, Jedi,
            and Sith specialists, and converges on the synthesizer, which returns the final answer.
        </desc>

        <defs>
            <linearGradient id="hero-node" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
                <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#22d3ee" />
                <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#8b5cf6" />
            </linearGradient>
        </defs>

        <g fill="none" stroke="rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35)" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path d="M96 160 H168" />
            <path d="M168 160 C 196 160, 196 30, 232 30" />
            <path d="M168 160 C 196 160, 196 82, 232 82" />
            <path d="M168 160 C 196 160, 196 134, 232 134" />
            <path d="M168 160 C 196 160, 196 186, 232 186" />
            <path d="M168 160 C 196 160, 196 238, 232 238" />
            <path d="M168 160 C 196 160, 196 290, 232 290" />
            <path d="M300 30 C 336 30, 336 160, 368 160" />
            <path d="M300 82 C 336 82, 336 160, 368 160" />
            <path d="M300 134 C 336 134, 336 160, 368 160" />
            <path d="M300 186 C 336 186, 336 160, 368 160" />
            <path d="M300 238 C 336 238, 336 160, 368 160" />
            <path d="M300 290 C 336 290, 336 160, 368 160" />
        </g>

        <g class="hero-art-pulse" fill="none" stroke="#22d3ee" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M96 160 H168" stroke-dasharray="18 54" />

            @* Each route lights up in turn, so the animation cycles through every specialist. *@
            <g class="hero-art-route" style="--route-index: 0">
                <path d="M168 160 C 196 160, 196 30, 232 30" stroke-dasharray="18 54" />
                <path d="M300 30 C 336 30, 336 160, 368 160" stroke-dasharray="18 54" />
            </g>
            <g class="hero-art-route" style="--route-index: 1">
                <path d="M168 160 C 196 160, 196 82, 232 82" stroke-dasharray="18 54" />
                <path d="M300 82 C 336 82, 336 160, 368 160" stroke-dasharray="18 54" />
            </g>
            <g class="hero-art-route" style="--route-index: 2">
                <path d="M168 160 C 196 160, 196 134, 232 134" stroke-dasharray="18 54" />
                <path d="M300 134 C 336 134, 336 160, 368 160" stroke-dasharray="18 54" />
            </g>
            <g class="hero-art-route" style="--route-index: 3">
                <path d="M168 160 C 196 160, 196 186, 232 186" stroke-dasharray="18 54" />
                <path d="M300 186 C 336 186, 336 160, 368 160" stroke-dasharray="18 54" />
            </g>
            <g class="hero-art-route" style="--route-index: 4">
                <path d="M168 160 C 196 160, 196 238, 232 238" stroke-dasharray="18 54" />
                <path d="M300 238 C 336 238, 336 160, 368 160" stroke-dasharray="18 54" />
            </g>
            <g class="hero-art-route" style="--route-index: 5">
                <path d="M168 160 C 196 160, 196 290, 232 290" stroke-dasharray="18 54" />
                <path d="M300 290 C 336 290, 336 160, 368 160" stroke-dasharray="18 54" />
            </g>
        </g>

        <circle cx="72" cy="160" r="22" fill="rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06)" stroke="rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.4)" />
        <text x="72" y="205" class="hero-art-label">You</text>

        <circle cx="168" cy="160" r="30" fill="url(#hero-node)" />
        <text x="168" y="112" class="hero-art-label">Orchestrator</text>

        <g fill="rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)" stroke="rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.35)">
            <rect x="232" y="14" width="68" height="32" rx="9" />
            <rect x="232" y="66" width="68" height="32" rx="9" />
            <rect x="232" y="118" width="68" height="32" rx="9" />
            <rect x="232" y="170" width="68" height="32" rx="9" />
            <rect x="232" y="222" width="68" height="32" rx="9" />
            <rect x="232" y="274" width="68" height="32" rx="9" />
        </g>

        <g class="hero-art-chip">
            <text x="266" y="34">Characters</text>
            <text x="266" y="86">Vehicles</text>
            <text x="266" y="138">Planets</text>
            <text x="266" y="190">Events</text>
            <text x="266" y="242">Jedi</text>
            <text x="266" y="294">Sith</text>
        </g>

        <circle cx="390" cy="160" r="28" fill="url(#hero-node)" />
        <text x="390" y="112" class="hero-art-label">Synthesizer</text>
    </svg>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <h2>How a question travels</h2>
    <ol class="flow-list">
        <li>
            <span class="flow-step">1</span>
            <div>
                <h3>The orchestrator classifies</h3>
                <p>Your request is categorized as a character, vehicle, planet, event, Jedi, or Sith question.</p>
            </div>
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="flow-step">2</span>
            <div>
                <h3>A specialist researches</h3>
                <p>The matching domain agent answers using the knowledge it was built for.</p>
            </div>
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="flow-step">3</span>
            <div>
                <h3>The synthesizer responds</h3>
                <p>The specialist's findings are rewritten into one clear, readable answer.</p>
            </div>
        </li>
    </ol>
</section>

<section class="section" id="specialists">
    <h2>Talk to a specialist directly</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">
        Skip the workflow when you already know the topic. Each specialist page keeps its own ongoing
        conversation, so you can ask follow-up questions in context.
    </p>

    <div class="card-grid">
        <a class="agent-card" href="characters">
            <h3>Characters</h3>
            <p>People across the galaxy, their allegiances, and their histories.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="agent-card" href="vehicles">
            <h3>Vehicles</h3>
            <p>Starships, speeders, and the craft that move them between worlds.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="agent-card" href="planets">
            <h3>Planets</h3>
            <p>Worlds, systems, climates, and the people who inhabit them.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="agent-card" href="events">
            <h3>Events</h3>
            <p>Battles, treaties, and the turning points that shaped the galaxy.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="agent-card" href="jedi">
            <h3>Jedi</h3>
            <p>Jedi teachings, members of the Order, and the light side of the Force.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="agent-card" href="sith">
            <h3>Sith</h3>
            <p>Sith history, dark side traditions, and the lineages of their orders.</p>
        </a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <h2>Getting started</h2>
    <p class="section-lead">
        Holonet Agents talks to agents that already exist in your Foundry project, so there is nothing to
        train or deploy here. Sign in with an identity that has the <strong>Azure AI User</strong> role on
        the project, then open Holonet Chat and ask a question. Use <strong>New conversation</strong> at any
        time to clear the current chat and start fresh.
    </p>
</section>
